---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
const timeline = [
  ['1991', 'Multiple Industries begins manufacturing and trading in Uganda.'],
  ['2013', 'Automotive division launched: Fras-le brake lining and pads, Hanksugi truck tyres, Hengst fuel and air filters.'],
  ['2019', 'Inland Freight Services starts: transport and logistics across East Africa.'],
  ['Today', 'ISO 9001:2015 certified, with products certified by the Uganda National Bureau of Standards (UNBS).'],
];
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | Multiple Industries Ltd"
  description="Since 1991 Multiple Industries has led the manufacture and trade of building materials, plasticware, automotive spare parts and transport services in Uganda. ISO 9001:2015 certified."
  crumbs={[{ name: 'About', href: '/about' }]}
>
  <PageHead eyebrow="About us" title="Manufacturing and supplying Uganda since 1991." crumbs={[{ name: 'About' }]}
    lead="Leading manufacturing and trading of domestic and industrial building materials, domestic plasticware, automotive spare parts and transport services in Uganda." />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-x grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="space-y-5 text-lg text-muted">
        <p>From plastic pipes to concrete products, we cover indoor and outdoor plumbing, rainwater gutters, Light Gauge Steel Frame roof trusses, kitchen and bathroom solutions, and roofing solutions.</p>
        <p>Our plasticware range includes jerry cans, basins, buckets, cups, mugs, plates, wrapped drinking straws, tiffin boxes and trays, made from food-grade raw materials.</p>
        <p>We are ISO 9001:2015 certified, and our products are certified by the Uganda National Bureau of Standards (UNBS).</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="relative space-y-6 border-l border-line pl-6">
        {timeline.map(([y, t]) => (
          <li class="reveal relative">
            <span class="absolute -left-[1.95rem] top-2 h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-cyan shadow-[0_0_14px_var(--color-cyan)]"></span>
            <p class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-gradient">{y}</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-muted">{t}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section border-t border-line bg-surface">
    <div class="container-x grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="card p-7"><p class="eyebrow">Mission</p><p class="mt-3 text-muted">Having a competent, experienced and motivated team, and continual interactions with our customers and other interested parties, we will manufacture and sell top quality plastic products, and supply reliable building materials, selected automotive products, irrigation systems to satisfy and exceed customer requirements and increase shareholder value while maintaining a sustainable environment.</p></article>
      <article class="card p-7"><p class="eyebrow">Vision</p><p class="mt-3 text-muted">To be the most preferred one stop source for quality building materials, general household items, selected automotive, irrigation and water management systems.</p></article>
      <article class="card p-7"><p class="eyebrow">Quality policy</p><p class="mt-3 text-muted">To manufacture and supply quality UPVC, HDPE, PP-R pipes in all sizes, drinking straws, domestic plastics and quality irrigation systems and building materials as a single stop for building and construction; and to position ourselves as market leader in Uganda and the East African Community through a Quality Management System in accordance with ISO 9001:2015.</p></article>
    </div>
    <p class="container-x mt-6 text-sm text-muted">TODO: add Certificates, CSR Activities and Achievements content from the old site.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
